# Agent git worktrees. 1.7 GB at the time this line was written, sitting inside
# the repository as UNTRACKED — which is one `git add -A` away from being
# committed. .claude/settings.json stays tracked; only the worktrees are noise.
.claude/worktrees/

# Editor/merge leftovers. These were TRACKED until the release audit
# (2026-08-08): src/codegen.zig.bak alone was 1.3 MB of a stale copy of the
# file five agents are live in, and a .rej beside src/macro_expand.zig read as
# an unresolved conflict shipped on purpose.
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# Root scratch that was tracked before the patterns above existed. Two-line
# `pub fn main() !void {}` stubs, loose .wasm blobs, and repomix.md — a 1 MB
# machine-generated dump of this same repository, which is a stale duplicate of
# every file next to it.
/repomix.md
/d2.wasm
/f6.wasm
/test.id
/test2.id
/test.zig
/run_test.zig
/tmp_dump_dnir.zig
/error_test.id

# Ad-hoc debug modules. Nothing in build.zig or src/ imports these.
/src/_dbg.zig
/src/_dbg2.zig
/src/_alias_dbg.zig

# Generated C. src/duo_lexer_tokenize.c is the one generated artifact that is
# deliberately tracked (build.zig links it); its retired sibling is not — see
# build.zig:linkProductionKeywordClassify.
duo_keyword_classify.c

# Session/agent control-plane state is not repository truth (epoch 2 audit).
# Tracked files need enduring architectural roles; claims, leases and session
# logs are stale within days. .agents/AGENT_COORDINATION.md is the durable
# document; everything mutable lives here and stays out of the index.
.agents/session/
.agents/claims/
.cursor/skills/

# tree-sitter's generated parser. `tree-sitter generate` writes parser.c (6 MB
# of C), node-types.json and a vendored tree_sitter/ header dir beside the
# tracked grammar.json. None of it is source and none of it may enter a
# monoglot repo by way of a sweeping `git add`. grammar.js + src/grammar.json
# stay tracked; see gaps/GAP-049.
/ext/tree-sitter-duo/src/parser.c
/ext/tree-sitter-duo/src/node-types.json
/ext/tree-sitter-duo/src/tree_sitter/
/ext/tree-sitter-idol/src/parser.c
/ext/tree-sitter-idol/src/node-types.json
/ext/tree-sitter-idol/src/tree_sitter/
